error[SC0409]: this writes `q`, which another argument of the same call writes too
   ╭─[ two_arguments_writing_one_pointer_are_reported.c:5:14 ]
   │
 5 │     g(q = 0, q = &x);
   │       ──┬──  ───┬──  
   │         ╰──────────── written here
   │                 │    
   │                 ╰──── written here as well
───╯
  = note: C17 6.5 p2 makes this call undefined wherever both are evaluated: nothing orders a call's arguments against each other (6.5 p3), only before the call (6.5.2.2 p10)
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign it in a statement of its own before the call
